{"ok":true,"cards":[{"id":"outline-gpt","category":"chat GPT","title":"簡報大綱產生器 GPTs","desc":"出題目、丟資料或多份文件融合，快速產出乾淨的簡報大綱，直接貼進簡報風格專案逐頁生成投影片。","linkUrl":"https://chatgpt.com/g/g-6a66c31e1cdc8191a0fb91072e7334f5-jian-bao-da-gang-chan-sheng-qi","tag":"ChatGPT GPTs","imageUrls":["assets/uploads/1785227522514.png"],"iconUrl":"","views":0,"type":"link","permission":"public","meta1":"open","meta2":"開啟 GPTs","meta3":"{\"i\":\"\",\"s\":\"primary\",\"c\":\"\"}","extra":"{\"linkBehavior\":\"open\",\"linkBtnLabel\":\"開啟 GPTs\",\"linkBtnIcon\":\"\",\"copyContent\":\"\",\"btnStyle\":\"primary\"}","page":"chat GPT","visible":true,"pinned":false},{"id":"gpt-slides-hub","category":"chat GPT","title":"chat GPT 專案｜簡報風格指令庫","desc":"ChatGPT 專案功能：依照簡報大綱，逐頁連續生成獨立的投影片圖片。使用同一份風格檔，統一全套簡報的配色、字體、插畫、圖示、構圖與版面規則。頁數較多時，可分批生成並接續前次進度，維持跨批次的內容與視覺一致性。將生成完成的圖片依照頁碼排序，自動組裝成 PowerPoint 檔。可同時讀取多份簡報，整合重複內容、重新安排資訊順序，規劃成一份結構完整的新簡報。可針對單份簡報進行視覺優化，在不增加、不刪除、不合併頁面的前提下，保留原有頁數、內容重點與排列順序，僅重新套用指定的視覺風格。可依需求製作「圖像式簡報」或進一步重建為文字、圖形與圖表可編輯的 PowerPoint 版本。","linkUrl":"https://jyunhao914.github.io/ai-tools-platform/gpt-slides/","tag":"ChatGPT 專案","imageUrls":["assets/uploads/1785226778708.png"],"iconUrl":"","views":0,"type":"link","permission":"public","meta1":"open","meta2":"開啟指令庫","meta3":"{\"i\":\"\",\"s\":\"primary\",\"c\":\"\"}","extra":"{\"linkBehavior\":\"open\",\"linkBtnLabel\":\"開啟指令庫\",\"linkBtnIcon\":\"\",\"copyContent\":\"\",\"btnStyle\":\"primary\"}","page":"chat GPT","visible":true,"pinned":false},{"id":"1774336711150_2","category":"Gemini notebook","title":"風格檔：扁平插畫漸層背景粉紅色系","desc":"YAML檔的連結加入資料來源，就能輕鬆產出具備一致視覺風格的簡報","linkUrl":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1p7i882bEzOqEScx01YLKbQtHLvBJNobNF9sdg_PY3nQ/edit?usp=sharing","tag":"YAML","imageUrls":["assets/uploads/thumb_1N5EwBjQqT3W.jpg"],"iconUrl":"","views":1044,"type":"link","permission":"public","meta1":"copy","meta2":"複製連結","meta3":"{\"i\":\"\",\"s\":\"primary\",\"c\":\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1p7i882bEzOqEScx01YLKbQtHLvBJNobNF9sdg_PY3nQ/edit?usp=s