謹、重點清晰的現代化專業文案。透過強大的 AI 處理能力，系統能實現「視覺全面升級，內容絕對精準」的雙重目標。<br><div><br></div><div><br><span class=\\\"inline-copy-btn\\\" data-label=\\\"點我複製指令\\\" data-icon=\\\"📋\\\" data-content-type=\\\"text\\\" data-style=\\\"primary\\\" data-mode=\\\"inline\\\" data-copy-b64=\\\"\\\" data-desc=\\\"貼入設定對話自訂欄位\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\"><span class=\\\"icb-bar\\\"><span class=\\\"icb-action style-primary\\\">📋 點我複製指令</span></span></span><br><img src=\\\"assets/uploads/article_1774427140806_2.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"uploaded image\\\"></div><div><br></div><div>NotebookLM 來源必須有三項 『原始簡報』、『原始簡報轉Markdown』、『YAML風格檔』<br><br>原始簡報轉Markdown工具&nbsp; &nbsp;</div><div><span class=\\\"inline-copy-btn\\\" data-label=\\\"前往轉檔\\\" data-icon=\\\"📋\\\" data-content-type=\\\"text\\\" data-style=\\\"primary\\\" data-mode=\\\"inline\\\" data-copy-b64=\\\"aHR0cHM6Ly9nZW1pbmkuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbS9nZW0vMTRrT1J0LXdCR3JIWUlyVXhjRjR2N01tLTVnLTF1MXpuP3VzcD1zaGFyaW5n\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\"><span class=\\\"icb-bar\\\"><span class=\\\"icb-action style-primary\\\">📋 前往轉檔</span></span></span><br><br></div><div><br></div>\",\"author\":\"\",\"coverImage\":\"assets/uploads/thumb_1iOuRTC1m91W.jpg\",\"publishDate\":\"2026-03-25T09:35:33.887Z\"}","page":"Gemini notebook","visible":true,"pinned":false},{"id":"1774529157958","category":"Gemini notebook","title":"NotebookLM 工作室加強版","desc":"在 NotebookLM 工作室新增「重排版簡報」和「批次輸出」模組。自動偵測 AI 產出的分頁大綱，逐批丟進 Studio 自訂簡報生成。\n\n【安裝】\n1. 先安裝 Tampermonkey 擴充功能（Chrome/Edge/Firefox）\n2. 點擊本卡片連結 → Tampermonkey 自動彈出安裝視窗 → 點「安裝」即完成\n3. 打開 NotebookLM 工作室即可看到新模組\n\n【移除】\n點 Chrome 右上角 Tampermonkey 圖示 → 管理面板 → 找到此腳本 → 點垃圾桶刪除","linkUrl":"","tag":"NotebookLM 進階技巧","imageUrls":["assets/uploads/thumb_19-jiAQMnfgB.jpg"],"iconUrl":"","views":0,"type":"article","permission":"public","meta1":"","meta2":"","meta3":"","content":"在 NotebookLM 工作室新增「重排版簡報」和「批次輸出」模組。自動偵測 AI 產出的分頁大綱，逐批丟進 Studio 自訂簡報生成。【安裝擴充功能】1. 先安裝 Tampermonkey 擴充功能（Chrome/Edge/Firefox）2. 點擊本卡片連結 → Tampermonkey 自動彈出安裝視窗 → 點「安裝」即完成3. 打開 Notebo