pdf 簡報自動變成有聲 1080p MP4 影片的桌面軟體（Mac / Windows 都有）。\n從講稿、配音到影片輸出，一站完成：匯入簡報 → AI 逐頁寫講稿 → 自然台灣聲音配音 → 輸出 1080p MP4。\n\n分為 Lite／標準版／Pro 三個版本，本頁提供 Lite 版下載。","author":"","coverImage":"assets/voicebox-thumb.jpg","publishDate":"2026-06-10T06:10:42.604Z","extra":"{\"content\": \"<div style=\\\"max-width:900px;margin:auto\\\">\\n\\n<h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Voicebox — 一份簡報進去，一部有聲影片出來</h2>\\n\\n<p><strong>Voicebox</strong> 是一款把 <code>.pptx</code> / <code>.pdf</code> 簡報自動變成\\n<strong>有聲 1080p MP4 影片</strong>的桌面軟體（Mac / Windows 都有）。\\n從講稿、配音到影片輸出，一站完成：匯入簡報 → AI 逐頁看內容、逐頁寫講稿 →\\n用自然台灣聲音（或克隆你自己的聲音）配音 → 輸出 1080p MP4。\\n不用進錄音室，也能快速完成專業有聲影片。</p>\\n\\n<h3>🎯 為什麼選擇 Voicebox</h3>\\n<ul>\\n  <li><strong>自然台灣聲音</strong> — 清楚專業、可信賴，不是大陸腔，也不是機器腔</li>\\n  <li><strong>AI 逐頁寫講稿</strong> — 看懂每頁投影片實際內容再撰稿，前後連貫；聽眾、時長、語氣都可設定，每頁能單獨修改、試聽，滿意再出片</li>\\n  <li><strong>8 秒克隆你的聲音</strong>（Pro）— 錄一小段中文，中英文都能用同一音色朗讀；從收音、品質檢核、降噪到發音驗證，每一步都有把關</li>\\n  <li><strong>真離線・真隱私</strong>（標準版／Pro）— AI 講稿、語音辨識與聲音合成都在本機完成，機密內容不出機器</li>\\n  <li><strong>一站式影片製作</strong> — 逐頁編輯、試聽，一鍵輸出 1080p 影片</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<h3>📦 三個版本，怎麼選？</h3>\\n<p>Voicebox 分為 <strong>Lite</strong>、<strong>標準版</strong>、<strong>Pro</strong> 三個版本：</p>\\n<div style=\\\"overflow-x:auto\\\">\\n<table style=\\\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;margin:12px 0\\\">\\n  <thead>\\n    <tr style=\\\"background:rgba(79,140,255,.12)\\\">\\n      <th style=\\\"padding:10px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3);text-align:left\\\">功能</th>\\n      <th style=\\\"padding:10px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">Lite<br><span style=\\\"font-weight:400;font-size:12px;color:#8b93a7\\\">輕巧上手・雲端聲音</span></th>\\n      <th style=\\\"padding:10px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">標準版<br><span style=\\\"font-weight:400;font-size:12px;color:#8b93a7\\\">離線工作・資料不外流</span></th>\\n      <th style=\\\"padding:10px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">Pro<br><span style=\\\"font-weight:400;font-size:12px;color:#8b93a7\\\">你的聲音・全能旗艦</span></th>\\n    </tr>\\n  </thead>\\n  <tbody style=\\\"text-align:center\\\">\\n    <tr><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3);text-align:left\\\">簡報轉影片</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">✅</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">✅</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">✅</td></tr>\\n    <tr><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3);text-align:left\\\">文字轉語音</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">✅</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">✅</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">✅</td></tr>\\n    <tr><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3);text-align:left\\\">讀音校正</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">✅</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">✅</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">✅</td></tr>\\n    <tr><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3);text-align:left\\\">Gemini 雲端講稿</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">✅</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">✅</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">✅</td></tr>\\n    <tr><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3);text-align:left\\\">影音轉文字</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">—</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">✅</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">✅</td></tr>\\n    <tr><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3);text-align:left\\\">本機 AI 講稿（離線）</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">—</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">✅</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">✅</td></tr>\\n    <tr><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3);text-align:left\\\">離線 12 種台灣聲音</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">—</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">Mac 有／Win 無</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">✅</td></tr>\\n    <tr><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3);text-align:left\\\">8 秒聲音克隆</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">—</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">—</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">✅</td></tr>\\n    <tr><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3);text-align:left\\\">換聲翻譯</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">—</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">—</td><td style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(139,147,167,.3)\\\">✅</td></tr>\\n  </tbody>\\n</table>\\n</div>\\n<ul>\\n  <li><strong>Lite</strong>：適合偶爾製作影片、電腦空間有限的人（講稿走 Gemini 雲端）</li>\\n  <li><strong>標準版</strong>：適合經常製作影片、重視內容隱私的人（AI 講稿在本機離線完成）</li>\\n  <li><strong>Pro</strong>：適合需要自己的聲音、換聲與翻譯配音的人</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<h3>⬇️ 下載安裝（Lite 版）</h3>\\n<p>以下提供的是 <strong>Voicebox Lite</strong>；標準版與 Pro 請另行洽詢取得。</p>\\n\\n<div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:16px 0\\\">\\n\\n  <a href=\\\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1x9Xip2Lg4jK0YmzE-IL5aeMEZxbVvJcZ/view?usp=sharing\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:260px;padding:18px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4f8cff,#3b6fd6);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;display:block\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;opacity:0.85\\\">🍎 macOS</div>\\n    <div style=\\\"font-size:18px;font-weight:600;margin-top:4px\\\">Voicebox Lite（Mac 版）</div>\\n    <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;opacity:0.75;margin-top:4px\\\">DMG 一鍵安裝</div>\\n  </a>\\n\\n  <a href=\\\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1fmrBCRTYwLQv-Ezp1ygClLaVepQFVm8A/view?usp=sharing\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:260px;padding:18px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5a67d8,#4c51bf);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;display:block\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;opacity:0.85\\\">🪟 Windows</div>\\n    <div style=\\\"font-size:18px;font-weight:600;margin-top:4px\\\">Voicebox Lite（Windows 版）</div>\\n    <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;opacity:0.75;margin-top:4px\\\">Setup 一鍵安裝</div>\\n  </a>\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n<h3>✍️ 講稿產生工具</h3>\\n<p>不想自己寫講稿？用以下 AI 助手上傳簡報 PDF，就能自動產生逐頁講稿，輸出格式直接相容 Voicebox（每頁以空白行分隔），存成 .txt 或 .docx 回 Voicebox 上傳即可：</p>\\n\\n<div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:16px 0\\\">\\n\\n  <a href=\\\"https://gemini.google.com/gem/1AGSY5Oy2-zGerwW1VpB_6qtOPmJhF2w0?usp=sharing\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:260px;padding:18px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8e6bd8,#6d4fc4);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;display:block\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;opacity:0.85\\\">✨ Gemini Gem</div>\\n    <div style=\\\"font-size:18px;font-weight:600;margin-top:4px\\\">Voicebox 講稿助手（Gemini 版）</div>\\n    <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;opacity:0.75;margin-top:4px\\\">用 Google 帳號開啟即可使用</div>\\n  </a>\\n\\n  <a href=\\\"https://chatgpt.com/g/g-6a6962c2dabc8191817dc87a7a0b06e5-voicebox-jiang-gao-zhu-shou\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:260px;padding:18px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#10a37f,#0d8a6a);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;display:block\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;opacity:0.85\\\">💬 ChatGPT GPTs</div>\\n    <div style=\\\"font-size:18px;font-weight:600;margin-top:4px\\\">Voicebox 講稿助手（GPT 版）</div>\\n    <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;opacity:0.75;margin-top:4px\\\">用 ChatGPT 帳號開啟即可使用</div>\\n  </a>\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n<h3>💡 適合誰用</h3>\\n<p>醫療／衛教、講師／教師、企業內訓／行銷、自媒體 —\\n只要你需要把簡報快速變成有聲影片，Voicebox 都能幫你省下大量錄音與剪輯時間：\\n50 頁簡報的講稿，傳統要寫 2–4 小時，AI 幾分鐘完成，再微調即可。</p>\\n\\n</div>\", \"author\": \"\", \"coverImage\": \"assets/voicebox-thumb.jpg\", \"publishDate\": \"2026-06-10T06:10:42.604Z\"}","page":"簡報轉影片","visible":true},{"id":"1776533629224","category":"簡報轉影片","title":"SlideCast — iPhone 變成你的攝影棚","desc":"SlideCast 讓你只需要一支 iPhone 或 iPad，就能完成簡報投影 + 老師入鏡的課程錄影。","linkUrl":"","tag":"iOS App","imageUrls":["assets/slidecast_cover.jpg"],"iconUrl":"","views":0,"type":"article","permission":"public","meta1":"","meta2":"","meta3":"","content":"帶著 iPhone 就能教學、錄製、投影。SlideCast 讓每一堂課都能留下高品質的教學影片，全程離線，影片直存相簿。\n\n🎬 介紹影片\n\n\n\n\n📥 立即下載\n📱 App Store 下載 SlideCast\n支援 iPhone 與 iPad（iOS / iPadOS 17 以上）。App Store 搜尋「SlideCast」也可直接安裝。\n\n✨ 適用情境\n\n教室 + 投影：站在黑板前，","author":"","coverImage":"assets/slidecast_cover.jpg","publishDate":"2026-04-22T00:41:33.475Z","extra":"{\"content\":\"<p><em>帶著 iPhone 就能教學、錄製、投影。SlideCast 讓每一堂課都能留下高品質的教學影片，全程離線，影片直存相簿。</em></p>\\n\\n<h2>🎬 介紹影片</h2>\\n<div style=\\\"position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%;height:0;overflow:hidden;margin:16px 0;border-radius:12px;\\\">\\n<iframe src=\\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/G-UCDKFGSeA\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:0;\\\" allow=\\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\\\" allowfullscreen=\\\"\\\"></iframe>\\n</div>\\n\\n<h2>📥 立即下載</h2>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https://apps.apple.com/tw/app/slidecast/id6761976538\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 28px;background:#00b4d8;color:#fff;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\\\">📱 App Store 下載 SlideCast</a></p>\\n<p>支援 iPhone 與 iPad（iOS / iPadOS 17 以上）。App Store 搜尋「SlideCast」也可直接安裝。</p>\\n\\n<h2>✨ 適用情境</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>教室 + 投影</strong>：站在黑板前，手持 iPhone，簡報投影在大螢幕，鏡頭同步錄下你的講解。下課後影片自動存到相簿。</li>\\n<li><strong>AirPlay / HDMI 外接螢幕</strong>：透過 AirPlay 或 HDMI 投影到大螢幕，SlideCast 同時錄下講師畫面與每一張投影片，一機搞定。</li>\\n<li><strong>搭配簡報筆</strong>：連接任何 Bluetooth 簡報筆，在台上自由走動翻頁，手不用碰 iPhone，鏡頭持續追蹤你的表情。</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<h2>🚀 核心功能</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>📄 PDF 簡報直接匯入</strong>：從 Files、iCloud Drive 或 AirDrop 匯入任何 PDF，每頁自動渲染成高解析度投影片。</li>\\n<li><strong>🎥 講師 PiP 子畫面</strong>：前鏡頭拍攝講師，子畫面浮在投影片角落。可調整大小、位置、形狀（矩形或圓形）。</li>\\n<li><strong>🎙 彈性音訊輸入</strong>：支援內建麥克風、AirPods、有線耳機及任何 USB-C / Lightning 音訊配件。</li>\\n<li><strong>📐 直式 / 橫式輸出</strong>：依需求選擇橫式（YouTube 16:9）或直式（Reels / TikTok 9:16）匯出格式。</li>\\n<li><strong>✏️ 時間軸剪輯</strong>：錄製後可對每個片段重新錄音、剪掉頭尾、調整片段順序，不需額外剪輯軟體。</li>\\n<li><strong>📱 重錄模式</strong>：對某一頁不滿意？直接重錄該頁即可，不必從頭錄製整份簡報。</li>\\n<li><strong>🖊 簡報筆支援</strong>：任何 Bluetooth HID 簡報筆皆可控制翻頁，在台上自由移動。</li>\\n<li><strong>📁 影片管理 &amp; 匯出</strong>：所有錄製影片集中管理，可直接分享、存入相簿，或匯出到其他 App。</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<h2>📖 三步驟開始錄製</h2>\\n<ol>\\n<li><strong>匯入 PDF 簡報</strong>：點擊首頁的「開啟 PDF」，從 Files App、iCloud Drive 或 AirDrop 選取你的簡報檔案。SlideCast 會自動渲染每一頁，並在頁數多時顯示載入進度。</li>\\n<li><strong>設定鏡頭、音訊與版面</strong>：選擇前置或後置鏡頭、麥克風來源，以及講師子畫面的大小與位置。可選擇橫式或直式輸出，即時預覽最終畫面。</li>\\n<li><strong>錄製 → 匯出 → 分享</strong>：點下錄製按鈕開始，翻頁用手指滑或搭配簡報筆。錄完後選擇片段進行剪輯，最後一鍵匯出影片並儲存到相簿。</li>\\n</ol>\\n\\n<h2>🔒 完全本地運算，零上傳</h2>\\n<p>所有錄製、剪輯、匯出過程都在你的裝置上完成，SlideCast 不會將任何影片或音訊上傳到伺服器。影片直接存進相簿，資料永遠在你手上。</p>\\n\\n<h2>📮 聯絡與支援</h2>\\n<p>客服信箱：<a href=\\\"mailto:zxc80057@gmail.com\\\">zxc80057@gmail.com</a></p>\\n\",\"author\":\"\",\"coverImage\":\"assets/slidecast_cover.jpg\",\"publishDate\":\"2026-04-22T00:41:33.475Z\"}","page":"簡報轉影片","visible":true},{"id":"1776758305223","category":"Gemini notebook","title":"簡報精確轉譯Markdown 結構化引擎","desc":"將簡報精準轉譯為結構化 Markdown，保留標題層級、條列與段落邏輯，方便後續再製。","linkUrl":"https://gemini.google.com/gem/d81f877e086e","tag":"Gemini,簡報,Markdown","imageUrls":["assets/pres-md-engine-thumb.jpg"],"iconUrl":"","views":0,"type":"link","permission":"public","meta1":"open","meta2":"開啟 Gem","meta3":"{\"i\":\"\",\"s\":\"primary\",\"c\":\"\"}","extra":"{\"linkBehavior\":\"open\",\"linkBtnLabel\":\"開啟 Gem\",\"linkBtnIcon\":\"\",\"copyContent\":\"\",\"btnStyle\":\"primary\"}","page":"Gemini notebook","visible":true},{"id":"1776758318806","category":"Gremini GEM","title":"Storybook 故事繪本生成","desc":"用 Gemini Storybook Gem 把故事轉成具插畫風格的繪本頁面，適合說故事、教材、兒童創作。","linkUrl":"https://gemini.google.com/gem/storybook","tag":"Gemini,繪本,AI插畫","imageUrls":["assets/storybook-thumb.jpg"],"iconUrl":"","views":0,"type":"link","permission":"public","meta1":"open","meta2":"開啟 Storybook","meta3":"{\"i\":\"\",\"s\":\"primary\",\"c\":\"\"}","extra":"{\"linkBehavior\":\"open\",\"linkBtnLabel\":\"開啟 Storybook\",\"linkBtnIcon\":\"\",\"copyContent\":\"\",\"btnStyle\":\"primary\"}","page":"Gremini GEM","visible":true},{"id":"desk_card_generator_1","category":"工具箱","title":"桌牌產生器","desc":"上傳背景圖＋名單（Excel / CSV / Google 試算表 / 手動），批次產生展開式桌牌（上半自動倒轉），支援拼版預覽、PDF / PNG 匯出、模板儲存。","linkUrl":"tools/desk-card/","tag":"桌牌","imageUrls":["assets/desk-card-cover.jpg"],"iconUrl":"","views":0,"type":"link","permission":"public","meta1":"","meta2":"","meta3":"","extra":"{}"},{"id":"name_tag_generator_1","category":"工具箱","title":"名牌產生器","desc":"上傳背景圖＋名單（Excel / CSV / Google 試算表 / 手動），批次產生會議名牌。直式 / 橫式自由切換、尺寸完全自訂（90×55、85×54、100×70 預設或自訂），其他編輯與匯出邏輯與桌牌產生器相同。","linkUrl":"tools/name-tag/","tag":"名牌","imageUrls":["assets/name-tag-cover.jpg"],"iconUrl":"","views":0,"type":"link","permission":"public","meta1":"","meta2":"","meta3":"","extra":"{}"},{"id":"certificate_generator_1","category":"工具箱","title":"證書產生器","desc":"製作獎狀 / 結業證書 / 感謝狀。A4 直橫雙向、自訂尺寸、印章簽名圖片欄位、浮水印、直書 / 橫書、自動字號編號。其他編輯與匯出邏輯與桌牌、名牌一致。","linkUrl":"tools/certificate/","tag":"證書","imageUrls":["assets/certificate-cover.jpg"],"iconUrl":"","views":0,"type":"link","permission":"public","meta1":"","meta2":"","meta3":"","extra":"{}"},{"id":"passport_photo_gem_1","category":"工具箱","title":"台灣護照照片助手 (Gemini Gem)","desc":"上傳大頭照，自動檢查 / 裁切 / 換白底，產出符合台灣護照規範的數位照片（不修五官）。需要 Gemini 帳號。","linkUrl":"https://gemini.google.com/gem/1OA4f1h1f7-mP4Gm23cXaEezR6OOzGF6S?usp=sharing","tag":"Gemini Gem","imageUrls":["assets/passport-photo-cover.jpg"],"iconUrl":"","views":0,"type":"link","permission":"public","meta1":"","meta2":"","meta3":"","extra":"{}"},{"id":"presentation_script_gem_1","category":"工具箱","title":"簡報講稿產生器 (Gemini Gem)","desc":"上傳 PPT 或大綱，產出每張投影片可以直接念的口白逐字稿（含時長、互動提問、講者小提示、開場結尾範本、關鍵金句）。需要 Gemini 帳號。","linkUrl":"https://gemini.google.com/gem/1BdrWc2bGkB1o31UAqsBXkDeSM3LgHnGg?usp=sharing","tag":"Gemini Gem","imageUrls":["assets/script-gem-cover.jpg"],"iconUrl":"","views":0,"type":"link","permission":"public","meta1":"","meta2":"","meta3":"","extra":"{}"},{"id":"news_release_gem_1","category":"工具箱","title":"新聞稿產生器 (Gemini Gem)","desc":"活動結束後 2 分鐘內產出新聞稿、活動側記、FB 短文、LINE 推播多版本（一稿多用）。需要 Gemini 帳號。","linkUrl":"https://gemini.google.com/gem/13Wyi3wd121Yy3ByXp0SSLrCidphSvQ2p?usp=sharing","tag":"Gemini Gem","imageUrls":["assets/news-release-gem-cover.jpg"],"iconUrl":"","views":0,"type":"link","permission":"public","meta1":"","meta2":"","meta3":"","extra":"{}"},{"id":"tool_minicut","category":"工具箱","title":"Mini Cut — 影片剪輯轉檔工具(一鍵安裝)","desc":"輕量影片剪輯:去頭去尾、多段合併、畫面裁切、強力壓縮(目標檔案大小可低至 1MB)。一鍵安裝即用,內建 FFmpeg。Mac / Windows 雙平台。","linkUrl":"","tag":"影片工具","imageUrls":[],"iconUrl":"","views":0,"type":"article","permission":"public","meta1":"","meta2":"","meta3":"","content":"<p>輕量影片剪輯工具,專為長片場景設計。<strong>下載安裝即用,內建 FFmpeg 不需任何額外設定。</strong></p>\n\n<h2>核心功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>✂️ <strong>去頭去尾 + 多段合併</strong> — 拖曳入出點,串接多個影片,幀級精準</li>\n<li>🎬 <strong>畫面裁切</strong> — 直接拖曳綠框 / 拖角縮放 / 對稱裁","author":"","coverImage":"","publishDate":"2026-06-10T08:25:02.941Z","extra":"{\"content\":\"<p>輕量影片剪輯工具,專為長片場景設計。<strong>下載安裝即用,內建 FFmpeg 不需任何額外設定。</strong></p>\\n\\n<h2>核心功能</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li>✂️ <strong>去頭去尾 + 多段合併</strong> — 拖曳入出點,串接多個影片,幀級精準</li>\\n<li>🎬 <strong>畫面裁切</strong> — 直接拖曳綠框 / 拖角縮放 / 對稱裁切保持置中</li>\\n<li>📦 <strong>強力壓縮</strong> — 可指定目標檔案大小(最小 1MB),兩階段編碼精準達標</li>\\n<li>🎨 <strong>內建預設集</strong> — YouTube / Reels / TikTok / LINE 小檔 / 極限壓縮 / Podcast,亦可自訂</li>\\n<li>⚡ <strong>硬體加速</strong> — M 系列晶片極速編碼,Windows 自動偵測 NVENC / QuickSync</li>\\n<li>📊 <strong>即時進度</strong> + ↶ 復原(50 步)+ 📷 截圖 + 🛡️ 防睡眠 + 🔔 完成通知</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<h2>下載</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>📥 macOS Apple Silicon (M1/M2/M3 晶片)</strong>:<a href=\\\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1uphFR09QMD1k2yefKxa6qDNoSSkwO73v/view\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Mini Cut_0.8.0_aarch64.dmg(47 MB)</a></li>\\n<li><strong>📥 Windows 10/11 (64-bit)</strong>:<a href=\\\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/12s2LyUg7ohahoAWAloeKFMESGbbY9HJw/view\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Mini Cut_0.8.0_x64-setup.exe(90 MB)</a></li>\\n<li><strong>📥 macOS Intel</strong>:建置中,完成後同步上線</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<h2>安裝教學</h2>\\n\\n<h3>🍎 macOS 安裝</h3>\\n<ol>\\n<li>下載 .dmg 檔,雙擊打開</li>\\n<li>把「Mini Cut」拖到「Applications」資料夾</li>\\n<li><strong>第一次開啟會被擋(這是 Mac 安全機制)</strong>:\\n<ul>\\n<li>從 Launchpad 點 Mini Cut → 跳出「無法驗證開發者」 → 按 <strong>取消</strong></li>\\n<li>到 <strong>系統設定 → 隱私權與安全性</strong></li>\\n<li>頁面下方會看到「已封鎖 Mini Cut」 → 按右側 <strong>「仍要打開」</strong></li>\\n<li>跳出確認視窗 → 按 <strong>「打開」</strong></li>\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n<li>之後從 Dock / Spotlight / Launchpad 打開都不會再被擋</li>\\n</ol>\\n\\n<p>💡 <strong>進階一鍵解鎖(可選)</strong>:在「終端機」貼一行指令,完全跳過警告:</p>\\n<pre>xattr -d com.apple.quarantine \\\"/Applications/Mini Cut.app\\\"</pre>\\n\\n<h3>🪟 Windows 安裝</h3>\\n<ol>\\n<li>下載 .exe 檔,雙擊執行</li>\\n<li><strong>跳出「Windows 已保護您的電腦」(SmartScreen 警告)</strong>:\\n<ul>\\n<li>點 <strong>「其他資訊」</strong></li>\\n<li>下方出現 <strong>「仍要執行」</strong> 按鈕 → 按下去</li>\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n<li>跟著安裝精靈一路按「下一步」即可</li>\\n<li>桌面 / 開始選單就會出現 Mini Cut 圖示,直接點開</li>\\n</ol>\\n\\n<p>(SmartScreen 警告原因和 Mac 一樣 — 此 app 沒做付費的 Microsoft 程式碼簽署。執行後不會再警告。)</p>\\n\\n<h2>快速上手(3 步驟)</h2>\\n<ol>\\n<li><strong>拖入影片</strong> — 拖到視窗或點選擇檔案</li>\\n<li><strong>設定剪輯</strong> — 播到開始位置按 <kbd>I</kbd>,結束位置按 <kbd>O</kbd>;按 <kbd>Shift+空白</kbd> 預覽</li>\\n<li><strong>開始輸出</strong> — 右側選預設集 → 點藍色「開始輸出」</li>\\n</ol>\\n\\n<h2>必備快捷鍵</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li><kbd>空白</kbd> 播放/暫停 · <kbd>←</kbd>/<kbd>→</kbd> 逐幀</li>\\n<li><kbd>I</kbd> / <kbd>O</kbd> 設定入點 / 出點</li>\\n<li><kbd>Shift+空白</kbd> 預覽剪輯區段</li>\\n<li><kbd>Cmd/Ctrl+Z</kbd> 復原</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<h2>系統需求</h2>\\n<p>macOS 10.13+(Apple Silicon 完整支援) · Windows 10 1809 以上 / Windows 11(<strong>不支援 Win 7</strong>)。內建 FFmpeg,無需另裝。</p>\\n\\n<h2>FAQ</h2>\\n<p><strong>Q:可以壓到多小?</strong> 理論無下限,實測 5 秒短片可達 0.13 MB。但 1-2 小時影片塞 1MB 物理上不可能。</p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Q:為什麼會有「無法驗證開發者」/「SmartScreen」警告?</strong> 因為這是免費自製工具,沒花錢做 Apple Notarization / Microsoft Code Signing(每年費用)。功能完全正常,只需第一次手動打開一次。</p>\\n\",\"author\":\"\",\"coverImage\":\"\",\"publishDate\":\"2026-06-10T08:25:02.941Z\"}"},{"id":"1784863917877","category":"Gremini GEM","title":"消除模糊討好 — Gemini 版","desc":"多數 AI 會順著你討好附和，讓討論出現盲點、不說實話、走彎路。這個工具會直接指出問題、明講不確定與反對意見，把討論拉回正軌。","linkUrl":"https://gemini.google.com/gem/1eZiQrcbdSe07KSoUgECE0vPtyTn5mnUY?usp=sharing","tag":"Gemini Gem","imageUrls":["assets/anti-flattery-gemini-thumb.jpg"],"iconUrl":"","views":0,"type":"link","permission":"public","meta1":"open","meta2":"開啟 Gem","meta3":"{\"i\":\"\",\"s\":\"primary\",\"c\":\"\"}","extra":"{\"linkBehavior\":\"open\",\"linkBtnLabel\":\"開啟 Gem\",\"linkBtnIcon\":\"\",\"copyContent\":\"\",\"btnStyle\":\"primary\"}","page":"Gremini GEM","visible":true},{"id":"1784863922944","category":"Chat GPTs","title":"消除模糊討好 — GPT 版","desc":"多數 AI 會順著你討好附和，讓討論出現盲點、不說實話、走彎路。這個工具會直接指出問題、明講不確定與反對意見，把討論拉回正軌。","linkUrl":"https://chatgpt.com/g/g-6a62ccc7f77c8191b631b310e02e76fd","tag":"ChatGPT GPTs","imageUrls":["assets/anti-flattery-gpt-thumb.jpg"],"iconUrl":"","views":0,"type":"link","permission":"public","meta1":"open","meta2":"開啟 GPT","meta3":"{\"i\":\"\",\"s\":\"primary\",\"c\":\"\"}","extra":"{\"linkBehavior\":\"open\",\"linkBtnLabel\":\"開啟 GPT\",\"linkBtnIcon\":\"\",\"copyContent\":\"\",\"btnStyle\":\"primary\"}","page":"Chat GPTs","visible":true},{"id":"1785291000000","category":"Chat GPTs","title":"Voicebox 講稿助手 — GPT 版","desc":"上傳 PDF 自動產生逐頁講稿，輸出格式直接相容 Voicebox 軟體（每頁以空白行分隔，可貼到記事本 /